"Bogos Land Wellness is a comprehensive management application for a wellness center and salon, featuring dual interfaces for clients and administrators. The client-facing side includes an interactive booking system with a visual calendar, service catalog showcasing hair salon, hammam, hijama, manicure, and pedicure services, subscription plan selection, and a product shop for wellness items. The admin dashboard provides complete business management with client profiles and history, staff scheduling, inventory tracking with low-stock alerts, analytics with revenue charts and booking trends, and promotions management. The application uses React Router for navigation, Context API for global state management, Framer Motion for smooth animations, React Calendar for booking interface, and Recharts for data visualizations. The design emphasizes a calming spa aesthetic with glassmorphism effects, soft color palette (blues, greens, earth tones), gradient backgrounds, and wellness-themed imagery. Mock data simulates a fully operational system with clients, services, bookings, staff, inventory, and subscriptions. The architecture is modular with reusable components, form validation using React Hook Form, and responsive layouts optimized for mobile and desktop experiences. Key features include real-time availability checking, appointment conflict prevention, automated notifications, subscription tier management, and comprehensive business analytics.\\n\\n**Last changes:** Initial project setup with complete wellness center management system including client booking interface, admin dashboard, service catalog, subscription management, inventory tracking, staff management, and product shop with spa-inspired design and glassmorphism effects."